# European Villa Weather Analysis

A Python project using ERA5 reanalysis data from Copernicus to compare weather conditions across potential European holiday destinations.

## Locations

- Algarve
- South France
- Croatia
- Bosnia
- Barcelona Coast
- Romania

## Analysis

- Temperature
- Rainfall
- Sunshine
- Wind
- Outdoor comfort
- Holiday suitability ranking

## Tools

- Python
- CDS API
- Xarray
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- ERA5 Reanalysis